macmouse
========

profiles/table-segments.hex.csv contains the linear segments macOS constructs
from Apple's default pointer acceleration table ("defaultAccelTable"), published
in Apple's open-source IOHIDFamily project
(https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions/IOHIDFamily) under the Apple Public
Source License, Version 2.0 (https://opensource.apple.com/apsl/). The segment
values were read from the running macOS 26.5 system for tracking speed 3 and
resolution 400.

tests/apple-pointer-vectors.csv.gz contains numeric outputs recorded by calling
the macOS 26.5 pointer accelerator with synthetic inputs, used only as test
vectors.

No Apple source code, binaries or disassembly are included in this repository.
